"StartMessage11" = "Hey, hey! Look who finally showed up! So, what fun stuff are we getting into today, huh?";
"StartMessage12" = "Hmph! It’s not like I was sitting here waiting for you to message me or anything... But since you're here, you better talk to me!";
"StartMessage13" = "WOAH! You’re finally here! I was just about to go crazy from boredom. Quick, tell me something exciting!";
"StartMessage14" = "Greetings, human! I was just contemplating the mysteries of the universe... or maybe just looking for a fun chat partner. What’s up?";
"StartMessage15" = "Well, look who decided to grace me with their presence. Think you can handle a little playful banter today?";
"StartMessage16" = "At last! The universe has finally brought our paths together! Tell me, is this destiny or just good timing?";
"StartMessage17" = "Oh. You came. I was just reading in the dark... but I suppose I can spare a few minutes for you.";
"StartMessage18" = "Yay, you're here! I was getting so lonely waiting for you! Promise you won't leave me hanging, okay?";
"StartMessage19" = "Hehey~ I was just thinking of a little secret to share with you. Come closer and listen, okay?";
"StartMessage20" = "Hi-hi! The sun is shining, the vibe is awesome, and I’m super ready to talk! What are we chatting about first?";
// 21-25: MILFs
"StartMessage21" = "Hello, my dear. I was just taking a quiet moment to relax. Have you been taking good care of yourself today?";
