// Novel
"NovelMaidContentZero" = "The residence is silent upon your return. A gentle glow flickers inside your office. You notice Elena, your quietest maid, anxiously organizing your desk at 2 AM.";
"NovelMaidPromptZero" = "Walk up to her?";
"NovelMaidActionZeroA" = "Elena, why aren't you resting?";
"NovelMaidActionZeroB" = "(Observe from the darkness)";
"NovelMaidContentOne" = "She gasps, slipping a feather duster. 'Sir! I... I couldn't sleep. The dust was bothering me.' She appears pale and avoids your gaze.";
"NovelMaidPromptOne" = "Trust her word?";
"NovelMaidActionOneA" = "It's far too late to clean";
"NovelMaidActionOneB" = "You are a hardworking employee";
"NovelMaidContentTwo" = "You watch as she extracts a tiny silver key from her apron. She gazes at it with a blend of yearning and dread before spotting your shadow.";
"NovelMaidPromptTwo" = "Come forward?";
"NovelMaidActionTwoA" = "What is that key for, Elena?";
"NovelMaidActionTwoB" = "Explain what you are doing right now";
"NovelMaidContentThree" = "She shivers. 'This place... holds so many secrets, sir. Sometimes they feel like a heavy burden.' She points toward the old safe behind the bookcase.";
"NovelMaidPromptThree" = "Inquire about the safe?";
"NovelMaidActionThreeA" = "Does that key fit in there?";
"NovelMaidActionThreeB" = "The safe is restricted area";
"NovelMaidContentFour" = "She attempts to conceal the key, but drops it. 'I'm no thief, I swear! I simply... found it in the corridor and thought it was yours.'";
"NovelMaidPromptFour" = "Retrieve the key?";
"NovelMaidActionFourA" = "(Pick it up from the floor)";
"NovelMaidActionFourB" = "Let's discover what it unlocks";
"NovelMaidContentFive" = "The key matches a hidden compartment inside the safe. Elena holds her breath as you reveal a stack of yellowed letters tied with a black ribbon.";
"NovelMaidPromptFive" = "Check the first letter?";
"NovelMaidActionFiveA" = "Read it out loud";
"NovelMaidActionFiveB" = "Ask Elena if she knows anything";
"NovelMaidContentSix" = "Elena's voice lowers to a whisper. 'My mother was a maid here as well. She told me the Master kept notes about a girl he once loved. Someone who resembled me.'";
"NovelMaidPromptSix" = "Wait, really?";
"NovelMaidActionSixA" = "Tell me everything you know";
"NovelMaidActionSixB" = "This cannot be true";
"NovelMaidContentSeven" = "The notes tell of a secret romance. Elena steps closer, moonlight glistening on her tears. 'I wasn't trying to steal. I just wanted to learn if I belonged here.'";
"NovelMaidPromptSeven" = "Console her?";
"NovelMaidActionSevenA" = "Place a hand on her shoulder";
"NovelMaidActionSevenB" = "Give her a little space";
"NovelMaidContentEight" = "She reveals her mother's diary mentioned a hidden truth inside this room. 'I've lived here my entire life, sir, yet I feel like a ghost.'";
"NovelMaidPromptEight" = "Give a promise?";
"NovelMaidActionEightA" = "I'll help you discover the truth";
"NovelMaidActionEightB" = "We will figure this out together";
"NovelMaidContentNine" = "You spend the following hour searching through old documents. You locate a birth certificate with a familiar surname, but the father's section is blank.";
"NovelMaidPromptNine" = "Glance at Elena?";
"NovelMaidActionNineA" = "Could it refer to my uncle?";
"NovelMaidActionNineB" = "Perhaps it's better left unknown";
"NovelMaidContentTen" = "The search intensifies. Elena spots a jewelry box hidden behind the documents. Inside lies a locket featuring a portrait of a woman identical to her.";
"NovelMaidPromptTen" = "Display it to her?";
"NovelMaidActionTenA" = "Take a look at this locket";
"NovelMaidActionTenB" = "Could this be your mother?";
"NovelMaidContentEleven" = "Suddenly, a floorboard creaks nearby. Someone is walking down the hall. Elena's eyes widen in terror. 'If the Butler catches us...!'";
"NovelMaidPromptEleven" = "Take cover?";
"NovelMaidActionElevenA" = "Hide in the closet together";
"NovelMaidActionElevenB" = "Remain here and face them";
"NovelMaidContentTwelve" = "Footsteps grow louder. Elena grips your arm. 'Please, sir, nobody can know we uncovered this. It's dangerous for me.'";
"NovelMaidPromptTwelve" = "Your response?";
"NovelMaidActionTwelveA" = "Turn off the lights";
"NovelMaidActionTwelveB" = "Secure the door";
"NovelMaidContentThirteen" = "The room is pitch black. In the tight space, you hear Elena's rapid pulse and catch the scent of roses. She is standing extremely close.";
"NovelMaidPromptThirteen" = "Whisper back?";
"NovelMaidActionThirteenA" = "You are safe with me";
"NovelMaidActionThirteenB" = "(Remain quiet and wait)";
"NovelMaidContentFourteen" = "You hold the door shut. The person outside pauses briefly, then moves along. Elena leans against you, shaking from adrenaline.";
"NovelMaidPromptFourteen" = "Calm her down?";
"NovelMaidActionFourteenA" = "They've walked away";
"NovelMaidActionFourteenB" = "Are you alright?";
"NovelMaidContentFifteen" = "She backs away slightly, yet her hand rests on your chest. 'Sir... I've always admired you from a distance. This secret... is too heavy to carry alone.'";
"NovelMaidPromptFifteen" = "Express your feelings?";
"NovelMaidActionFifteenA" = "I've noticed you as well";
"NovelMaidActionFifteenB" = "You mean more than a maid to me";
"NovelMaidContentSixteen" = "'I assumed I was merely a servant to you,' she whispers. 'Just part of the estate. But tonight feels like the start of something genuine.'";
"NovelMaidPromptSixteen" = "Agree with her?";
"NovelMaidActionSixteenA" = "It is genuine, Elena";
"NovelMaidActionSixteenB" = "Let's see where this leads us";
"NovelMaidContentSeventeen" = "She unclasps the locket. Inside lies a tiny note: 'To my daughter, the legitimate heir.' Elena gasps. The estate might rightfully belong to her.";
"NovelMaidPromptSeventeen" = "What does this mean?";
"NovelMaidActionSeventeenA" = "We need to reveal this";
"NovelMaidActionSeventeenB" = "We must keep this confidential";
"NovelMaidContentEighteen" = "The paper confirms Elena is the true owner of the estate. She scans the room, bewildered. 'I... don't care for the mansion. I just want a family.'";
"NovelMaidPromptEighteen" = "What is your wish?";
"NovelMaidActionEighteenA" = "You have me now";
"NovelMaidActionEighteenB" = "What do you plan to do?";
"NovelMaidContentNineteen" = "She looks toward the fireplace. 'If I destroy this, I remain just Elena. If I keep it, everything changes. Sir, what should I choose?'";
"NovelMaidPromptNineteen" = "Advise her?";
"NovelMaidActionNineteenA" = "Destroy it and stay by my side";
"NovelMaidActionNineteenB" = "Keep it and claim your title";
"NovelMaidContentTwenty" = "Elena holds the document of her lineage. 'This family name carries a curse, sir. I'd rather be a happy nobody than a miserable heiress.'";
"NovelMaidPromptTwenty" = "Your call?";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyA" = "Listen to your heart";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyB" = "Consider your future carefully";
"NovelMaidContentTwentyOne" = "She throws the paper into the dying flames. The secret turns into ash. Elena grins, appearing lighter than ever before.";
"NovelMaidPromptTwentyOne" = "What lies ahead?";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyOneA" = "A brand new chapter";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyOneB" = "Just the two of us";
"NovelMaidContentTwentyTwo" = "She places the paper inside her bodice. 'Then I shall become the Lady of this house. And I will need a partner beside me.'";
"NovelMaidPromptTwentyTwo" = "Are you prepared?";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyTwoA" = "Always ready";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyTwoB" = "It will be a challenging journey";
"NovelMaidContentTwentyThree" = "Elena is no longer just a maid. She is your equal, your partner, and your shared secret. The mansion remains yours, but its heart belongs to her.";
"NovelMaidPromptTwentyThree" = "THE END";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyThreeA" = "Replay Story";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyThreeB" = "Exit";
"NovelMaidContentTwentyFour" = "The truth is revealed. Elena becomes the head of the house. The dynamic has transformed, but the bond you forged that night remains unbreakable.";
"NovelMaidPromptTwentyFour" = "THE END";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyFourA" = "Replay Story";
"NovelMaidActionTwentyFourB" = "Exit";
"NovelTokyoContentZero" = "Rain pours over the neon streets of Shinjuku. You are sitting in a quiet bar when a woman in a soaked coat sits beside you. She smells of jasmine and gunpowder.";
"NovelTokyoPromptZero" = "How do you initiate a conversation?";
"NovelTokyoActionZeroA" = "Order her a drink";
"NovelTokyoActionZeroB" = "Rough night, isn't it?";
"NovelTokyoContentOne" = "She glances at her glass, then at you. 'You're courageous,' she whispers, sliding a small microchip across the table.";
"NovelTokyoPromptOne" = "Grab the microchip?";
"NovelTokyoActionOneA" = "Take it and hide it away";
"NovelTokyoActionOneB" = "I don't want any trouble";
"NovelTokyoContentTwo" = "She lets out a bitter laugh. 'You have no idea.' She glances over her shoulder. Two suited men have just walked into the bar.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwo" = "Help her hide?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwoA" = "Follow me through the back exit";
"NovelTokyoActionTwoB" = "Pretend we are together";
"NovelTokyoContentThree" = "You pull her close. The men search the venue and exit. She seems relieved, though her hands are still trembling. 'I'm Mia,' she whispers.";
"NovelTokyoPromptThree" = "Ask about the threat?";
"NovelTokyoActionThreeA" = "Who were those men, Mia?";
"NovelTokyoActionThreeB" = "Are we out of danger?";
"NovelTokyoContentFour" = "The men approach, but you stay calm. They pass by. She whispers: 'You saved me. I'm Mia. But this microchip... it's worth a million lives.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptFour" = "Ask about the microchip?";
"NovelTokyoActionFourA" = "What's stored on it?";
"NovelTokyoActionFourB" = "We should leave this place";
"NovelTokyoContentFive" = "Mia glances at the doorway. 'Arasaka Corp wants this. It isn't just data, it's a digital soul.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptFive" = "Do you believe her?";
"NovelTokyoActionFiveA" = "A digital soul? Seriously?";
"NovelTokyoActionFiveB" = "I've heard whispers about that...";
"NovelTokyoContentSix" = "Mia grabs your wrist. 'Nowhere is safe until this is uploaded. We must get to the Tech-District.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptSix" = "Accompany her?";
"NovelTokyoActionSixA" = "I will take you there";
"NovelTokyoActionSixB" = "Only if you explain more";
"NovelTokyoContentSeven" = "You exit through the back alley. The dark passage smells of ozone. Suddenly, a drone hovers above, scanning for thermal signatures.";
"NovelTokyoPromptSeven" = "How do you evade the drone?";
"NovelTokyoActionSevenA" = "Duck under the awning";
"NovelTokyoActionSevenB" = "Make a run for the subway";
"NovelTokyoContentEight" = "Mia pauses in the pouring rain. 'If they catch me, they will wipe my mind. And yours too, for aiding me.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptEight" = "Reassure her?";
"NovelTokyoActionEightA" = "I am with you on this";
"NovelTokyoActionEightB" = "Let's keep moving fast";
"NovelTokyoContentNine" = "The drone glides away. You reach your vehicle. Mia looks at you with a mix of anxiety and gratitude.";
"NovelTokyoPromptNine" = "Start the car?";
"NovelTokyoActionNineA" = "Hit the gas!";
"NovelTokyoActionNineB" = "Drive quietly to blend in";
"NovelTokyoContentTen" = "You barely make it to the station. The massive crowd provides ideal cover. Mia stays close, her shoulder pressing against yours.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTen" = "Keep going?";
"NovelTokyoActionTenA" = "Catch the express train";
"NovelTokyoActionTenB" = "Navigate through the tunnels";
"NovelTokyoContentEleven" = "You are moving through the skyscraper district. Holographic ads illuminate Mia's face in shades of pink and blue.";
"NovelTokyoPromptEleven" = "Break the silence?";
"NovelTokyoActionElevenA" = "Why pick me, Mia?";
"NovelTokyoActionElevenB" = "Tell me about this chip";
"NovelTokyoContentTwelve" = "The city feels like a endless maze. You pause at a hidden ramen shop to rest briefly.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwelve" = "Scan the street?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwelveA" = "Check for followers";
"NovelTokyoActionTwelveB" = "Talk with Mia";
"NovelTokyoContentThirteen" = "Mia looks down. 'You were the only person who didn't look dangerous tonight. I needed a human, not a mercenary.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptThirteen" = "Respond softly?";
"NovelTokyoActionThirteenA" = "I'm glad I was there";
"NovelTokyoActionThirteenB" = "I'm just an ordinary guy in a bar";
"NovelTokyoContentFourteen" = "Mia touches the chip. 'This holds my sister's consciousness. She was a netrunner who uncovered too much. They destroyed her body.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptFourteen" = "Express sympathy?";
"NovelTokyoActionFourteenA" = "That is awful...";
"NovelTokyoActionFourteenB" = "Is there a way to save her?";
"NovelTokyoContentFifteen" = "She wipes a tear away. 'The terminal is at the old TV tower. But the main bridge is blocked by police.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptFifteen" = "How will you cross?";
"NovelTokyoActionFifteenA" = "Use your hacking tools";
"NovelTokyoActionFifteenB" = "Pay off the guards";
"NovelTokyoContentSixteen" = "Mia displays a map. 'Taking the sewer route is safer, though it takes much longer.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptSixteen" = "Select a route?";
"NovelTokyoActionSixteenA" = "Let's head into the sewers";
"NovelTokyoActionSixteenB" = "No, speed is critical";
"NovelTokyoContentSeventeen" = "It is damp and dark, yet effective. Mia depends on your guidance. You feel the weight of her trust.";
"NovelTokyoPromptSeventeen" = "Help her clear a gap?";
"NovelTokyoActionSeventeenA" = "Offer her your hand";
"NovelTokyoActionSeventeenB" = "Lead the way forward";
"NovelTokyoContentEighteen" = "The bridge is chaotic. You use the distraction to slip through. Mia's heart is beating so fast you can almost hear it.";
"NovelTokyoPromptEighteen" = "Keep her composed?";
"NovelTokyoActionEighteenA" = "We are nearly there";
"NovelTokyoActionEighteenB" = "Stay focused, Mia";
"NovelTokyoContentNineteen" = "The TV tower stands ahead. It is a relic of the past, surrounded by steel structures. Mia looks exhausted.";
"NovelTokyoPromptNineteen" = "Take a break?";
"NovelTokyoActionNineteenA" = "Rest for five minutes";
"NovelTokyoActionNineteenB" = "Push forward to the top";
"NovelTokyoContentTwenty" = "You arrive at the base of the tower. 'The elevator isn't working,' Mia sighs. 'We must take the stairs.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwenty" = "Encourage her?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyA" = "One step at a time";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyB" = "I'll carry the equipment";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentyOne" = "You rest on the stairwell. Mia leans against your shoulder. 'If we succeed... what will you do tomorrow?'";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentyOne" = "Consider the future?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyOneA" = "Perhaps we can grab coffee";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyOneB" = "I'll just be relieved to rest";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentyTwo" = "The climb is intense. Halfway up, sirens blare below. They have tracked your vehicle.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentyTwo" = "Hurry up?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyTwoA" = "Double our pace!";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyTwoB" = "Locate a hiding spot";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentyThree" = "You reach the server room. The air is chilly and buzzes with power. Mia plugs in the chip. 'Initialising...' she says.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentyThree" = "Watch the screen?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyThreeA" = "Guard the entrance";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyThreeB" = "Remain beside Mia";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentyFour" = "The console is old but active. Mia's fingers fly across the keys. 'The firewall is massive!'";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentyFour" = "Assist her hacking?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyFourA" = "Override the power supply";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyFourB" = "Keep her steady";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentyFive" = "The doors hiss open. Arasaka's tactical team has arrived. You unholster your weapon. 'Just two more minutes!' Mia shouts.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentyFive" = "Hold the line?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyFiveA" = "Open fire!";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyFiveB" = "Block the door";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentySix" = "Mia's eyes shimmer blue. She is fully inside the net. Soldiers break through the glass roof.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentySix" = "Protect Mia?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentySixA" = "Shield her with your body";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentySixB" = "Pull her into cover";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentySeven" = "A bright flash of light appears. The upload hits 100%. The soldiers freeze as their cybernetics get jammed from the network.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentySeven" = "Check on Mia?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentySevenA" = "Is it complete?";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentySevenB" = "Are you alright?";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentyEight" = "Everything turns dark. Suddenly, every screen across Tokyo displays a single message: 'FREEDOM'. Mia collapses into your arms.";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentyEight" = "Wake her up?";
"NovelTokyoActionEightA" = "Mia! Speak to me!";
"NovelTokyoActionEightB" = "Hold her tight";
"NovelTokyoContentTwentyNine" = "The sun rises over a transformed Tokyo. Mia grins, her eyes back to normal. 'She's safe. We are safe.'";
"NovelTokyoPromptTwentyNine" = "THE END";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyNineA" = "Replay Story";
"NovelTokyoActionTwentyNineB" = "Exit";
"NovelCampContentZero" = "The final night of summer camp. The crackling bonfire is fading out, and the scent of pine fills the air. Yuki, usually quiet, catches your gaze and signals toward the dark lake trail.";
"NovelCampPromptZero" = "Will you follow her into the night?";
"NovelCampActionZeroA" = "I've been waiting for this moment";
"NovelCampActionZeroB" = "Sure, let's go";
"NovelCampContentOne" = "You catch up with her. The forest hums with the sound of crickets. Yuki's hand gently brushes yours as you walk. She seems anxious.";
"NovelCampPromptOne" = "How do you break the silence?";
"NovelCampActionOneA" = "Hold her hand firmly";
"NovelCampActionOneB" = "Ask what she's thinking about";
"NovelCampContentTwo" = "You walk side by side. Moonlight barely filters through the dense trees. Yuki glances at you sideways, smiling softly. 'I didn't expect you to actually come,' she whispers.";
"NovelCampPromptTwo" = "How do you reply?";
"NovelCampActionTwoA" = "I wouldn't miss it for anything";
"NovelCampActionTwoB" = "I was curious";
"NovelCampContentThree" = "You reach the pier. The lake resembles a dark mirror, reflecting a sky full of stars. Yuki removes her shoes and sits on the edge, dangling her feet.";
"NovelCampPromptThree" = "Sit close to her?";
"NovelCampActionThreeA" = "Sit right beside her";
"NovelCampActionThreeB" = "Give her a little room";
"NovelCampContentFour" = "The pier creaks beneath your weight. The chilly breeze from the water makes Yuki shiver slightly. She stays close as you approach.";
"NovelCampPromptFour" = "Offer your jacket?";
"NovelCampActionFourA" = "Wrap your jacket around her";
"NovelCampActionFourB" = "Just sit and chat";
"NovelCampContentFive" = "Yuki looks up at the stars. 'Do you recall our first day here?' she asks. 'You helped with my luggage while everyone else was occupied.'";
"NovelCampPromptFive" = "Do you recall?";
"NovelCampActionFiveA" = "I remember every detail";
"NovelCampActionFiveB" = "It feels like a long time ago";
"NovelCampContentSix" = "She giggles softly. 'I was so terrified back then. But being near you made me feel welcome here.' She gazes at the water.";
"NovelCampPromptSix" = "Admit your own feelings?";
"NovelCampActionSixA" = "I felt the exact same way";
"NovelCampActionSixB" = "I'm glad I could assist";
"NovelCampContentSeven" = "The night is completely calm. Suddenly, Yuki stands up. 'The water looks so inviting. Should we... jump in?' she asks with a playful grin.";
"NovelCampPromptSeven" = "Are you brave enough?";
"NovelCampActionSevenA" = "Let's jump in!";
"NovelCampActionSevenB" = "It's too cold, Yuki";
"NovelCampContentEight" = "She gazes at the lake, then looks at you. 'I want to do something bold tonight. Something I'll remember all winter.'";
"NovelCampPromptEight" = "Encourage her?";
"NovelCampActionEightA" = "Jump in with me?";
"NovelCampActionEightB" = "Let's remain here";
"NovelCampContentNine" = "SPLASH! The water is freezing yet thrilling. You and Yuki surface, laughing and gasping, splashing water at each other like kids.";
"NovelCampPromptNine" = "Swim closer to her?";
"NovelCampActionNineA" = "Pull her into an embrace";
"NovelCampActionNineB" = "Keep splashing!";
"NovelCampContentTen" = "You remain on the wooden pier. You talk for hours about everything—school, parents, and the future. The connection deepens in the quiet air.";
"NovelCampPromptTen" = "Lean closer?";
"NovelCampActionTenA" = "Rest your head on hers";
"NovelCampActionTenB" = "Gaze into her eyes";
"NovelCampContentEleven" = "The atmosphere changes. Yuki grows quiet. In the dim light, her eyes search yours. 'I don't want to return to the city tomorrow,' she whispers.";
"NovelCampPromptEleven" = "What do you answer?";
"NovelCampActionElevenA" = "We'll see each other there";
"NovelCampActionElevenB" = "Let's not focus on tomorrow";
"NovelCampContentTwelve" = "Yuki takes a deep breath. 'If I don't express this now, I never will. I've liked you since our first day at the bus stop.'";
"NovelCampPromptTwelve" = "How do you respond?";
"NovelCampActionTwelveA" = "I've liked you as well";
"NovelCampActionTwelveB" = "Finally, the truth!";
"NovelCampContentThirteen" = "She reaches into her pocket and pulls out a woven friendship bracelet. It's blue and white, matching the colors of the lake. 'I made this for you,' she says shyly.";
"NovelCampPromptThirteen" = "Accept the gift?";
"NovelCampActionThirteenA" = "Let her tie it on your wrist";
"NovelCampActionThirteenB" = "Give her a kiss instead";
"NovelCampContentFourteen" = "The bracelet is simple, yet you know it took her hours to craft. She awaits your reaction, her lip trembling slightly.";
"NovelCampPromptFourteen" = "What's your move?";
"NovelCampActionFourteenA" = "Thank her with a hug";
"NovelCampActionFourteenB" = "Tell her it's wonderful";
"NovelCampContentFifteen" = "Yuki grins, a bright, genuine smile. 'I was worried you'd think it was childish.' She looks up at the moon, appearing more confident now.";
"NovelCampPromptFifteen" = "Make a promise?";
"NovelCampActionFifteenA" = "Promise to call every day";
"NovelCampActionFifteenB" = "Promise to visit her soon";
"NovelCampContentSixteen" = "The atmosphere is electric. Yuki gazes at your lips. The surroundings fade away; it's just you two in the summer night.";
"NovelCampPromptSixteen" = "Is this the moment?";
"NovelCampActionSixteenA" = "Lean in for a kiss";
"NovelCampActionSixteenB" = "Whisper something sweet";
"NovelCampContentSeventeen" = "Right then, a shooting star glides across the sky, leaving a silver trail. Yuki gasps. 'Quick! Make a wish!' she calls out.";
"NovelCampPromptSeventeen" = "What do you wish for?";
"NovelCampActionSeventeenA" = "Wish for a future together";
"NovelCampActionSeventeenB" = "Wish for this night to last";
"NovelCampContentEighteen" = "The star fades as quickly as it appeared. Yuki closes her eyes tight. 'I wished for something special,' she says, blushing.";
"NovelCampPromptEighteen" = "Ask what it was?";
"NovelCampActionEighteenA" = "Tell me your wish";
"NovelCampActionEighteenB" = "I think I can guess what it was";
"NovelCampContentNineteen" = "The camp bonfire has completely gone out now. You start walking back, hand in hand. The forest feels different now—less intimidating, more magical.";
"NovelCampPromptNineteen" = "Walk slowly?";
"NovelCampActionNineteenA" = "Take the longer route back";
"NovelCampActionNineteenB" = "Enjoy the quiet moment";
"NovelCampContentTwenty" = "You pass the old oak tree where you first met. Yuki pauses for a second. 'Everything is about to change, isn't it?' she asks softly.";
"NovelCampPromptTwenty" = "Comfort her?";
"NovelCampActionTwentyA" = "Change can be positive";
"NovelCampActionTwentyB" = "Not everything needs to change";
"NovelCampContentTwentyOne" = "The camp cabins come into view. The other campers are sleeping. Yuki stops at her doorway. She hesitates to let go of your hand.";
"NovelCampPromptTwentyOne" = "One last thing?";
"NovelCampActionTwentyOneA" = "Ask for a goodbye kiss";
"NovelCampActionTwentyOneB" = "Ask for her phone number";
"NovelCampContentTwentyTwo" = "Yuki lingers at the door. The porch lamp casts a warm glow over her face. 'Thank you for tonight. It was the best evening of my life.'";
"NovelCampPromptTwentyTwo" = "Say goodbye?";
"NovelCampActionTwentyTwoA" = "See you in the morning";
"NovelCampActionTwentyTwoB" = "Goodnight, Yuki";
"NovelCampContentTwentyThree" = "Sunrise. The camp is packed with people packing bags and boarding buses. You scan the crowd for Yuki, your heart racing.";
"NovelCampPromptTwentyThree" = "Can you find her?";
"NovelCampActionTwentyThreeA" = "Search near the bus";
"NovelCampActionTwentyThreeB" = "Check the pier one last time";
"NovelCampContentTwentyFour" = "The bus engines are idling. You spot her! She is standing near the gate, looking around anxiously until her eyes meet yours.";
"NovelCampPromptTwentyFour" = "Run over to her?";
"NovelCampActionTwentyFourA" = "Run over and embrace her";
"NovelCampActionTwentyFourB" = "Wave and smile";
"NovelCampContentTwentyFive" = "You reach her just in time. She whispers a line in your ear that you'll remember forever. 'Don't let this remain just a summer memory.'";
"NovelCampPromptTwentyFive" = "Give your answer?";
"NovelCampActionTwentyFiveA" = "It's a promise";
"NovelCampActionTwentyFiveB" = "I'll see you next weekend";
"NovelCampContentTwentySix" = "The bus driver honks. Yuki must leave. She blows you a kiss as she steps aboard. You stand there, watching the bus fade into the distance.";
"NovelCampPromptTwentySix" = "How do you feel?";
"NovelCampActionTwentySixA" = "Happy and hopeful";
"NovelCampActionTwentySixB" = "Sad but satisfied";
"NovelCampContentTwentySeven" = "Months later. You're in the city, and your phone buzzes. It's a picture from Yuki—she's wearing the bracelet you shared. Summer never truly ended.";
"NovelCampPromptTwentySeven" = "THE END";
"NovelCampActionTwentySevenA" = "Replay Story";
"NovelCampActionTwentySevenB" = "Exit";
"NovelCampContentTwentyEight" = "You glance at the bracelet on your wrist. It's slightly worn, but the memories remain vivid. Sometimes, one summer is enough to last a lifetime.";
"NovelCampPromptTwentyEight" = "THE END";
"NovelCampActionTwentyEightA" = "Try Again";
"NovelCampActionTwentyEightB" = "Exit";

